NCCL API
Fused communication calls



Multiple calls to ncclSend() and ncclRecv()                                              Send/recv
should be fused with ncclGroupStart() and
                                                                                           ncclGroupStart();
ncclGroupEnd() to
                                                                                            ncclSend(sendbuff, sendcount, sendtype, peer, comm, stream);
Avoid deadlocks, e.g. if calls need to                                                      ncclRecv(recvbuff, recvcount, recvtype, peer, comm, stream);
 progress concurrently.                                                                    ncclGroupEnd();

For more performance: fused operations
  can be more efficient                                                                  Bcast
  by better utilizing the available IO.                                                    ncclGroupStart();
                                                                                             if (rank == root) {
                                                                                             for (int r=0; r<nranks; r++)
                                                                                               ncclSend(sendbuff[r], size, type, r, comm, stream);
                                                                                             }
                                                                                             ncclRecv(recvbuff, size, type, root, comm, stream);
                                                                                           ncclGroupEnd();




